§§ `Company officers (s 18)`

`co director consented` MEANS `Company officer facts` WITH
    `the body corporate's offence` IS `fa falsified for gain`
    `it is proved that the offence was committed with his consent or connivance` IS TRUE
    `he is a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate` IS TRUE
    `he purported to act in such a capacity` IS FALSE
    `the affairs of the body corporate are managed by its members and the act was his as a member in connection with his functions of management` IS FALSE
`co person purporting to act` MEANS `Company officer facts` WITH
    `the body corporate's offence` IS `fa falsified for gain`
    `it is proved that the offence was committed with his consent or connivance` IS TRUE
    `he is a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate` IS FALSE
    `he purported to act in such a capacity` IS TRUE
    `the affairs of the body corporate are managed by its members and the act was his as a member in connection with his functions of management` IS FALSE
`co managing member` MEANS `Company officer facts` WITH
    `the body corporate's offence` IS `fa falsified for gain`
    `it is proved that the offence was committed with his consent or connivance` IS TRUE
    `he is a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate` IS FALSE
    `he purported to act in such a capacity` IS FALSE
    `the affairs of the body corporate are managed by its members and the act was his as a member in connection with his functions of management` IS TRUE
`co director who did not consent` MEANS `Company officer facts` WITH
    `the body corporate's offence` IS `fa falsified for gain`
    `it is proved that the offence was committed with his consent or connivance` IS FALSE
    `he is a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate` IS TRUE
    `he purported to act in such a capacity` IS FALSE
    `the affairs of the body corporate are managed by its members and the act was his as a member in connection with his functions of management` IS FALSE
`co consenting outsider` MEANS `Company officer facts` WITH
    `the body corporate's offence` IS `fa falsified for gain`
    `it is proved that the offence was committed with his consent or connivance` IS TRUE
    `he is a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate` IS FALSE
    `he purported to act in such a capacity` IS FALSE
    `the affairs of the body corporate are managed by its members and the act was his as a member in connection with his functions of management` IS FALSE
`co director but no offence by the company` MEANS `Company officer facts` WITH
    `the body corporate's offence` IS `fa falsified but not dishonest`
    `it is proved that the offence was committed with his consent or connivance` IS TRUE
    `he is a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate` IS TRUE
    `he purported to act in such a capacity` IS FALSE
    `the affairs of the body corporate are managed by its members and the act was his as a member in connection with his functions of management` IS FALSE

§§ `False statements by officers (s 19)`

`fs deceiving members` MEANS `False statement facts` WITH
    `he is an officer of a body corporate or unincorporated association, or purports to act as one` IS TRUE
    `the affairs of the body corporate or association are managed by its members and he is a member publishing in connection with his functions of management` IS FALSE
    `published or concurred in publishing a written statement or account` IS TRUE
    `to his knowledge the statement or account is or may be misleading, false or deceptive in a material particular` IS TRUE
    `he intended to deceive members about its affairs` IS TRUE
    `he intended to deceive creditors about its affairs` IS FALSE
    `he intended to deceive a person who has entered into a security for the benefit of the body corporate or association` IS FALSE
`fs deceiving creditors` MEANS `False statement facts` WITH
    `he is an officer of a body corporate or unincorporated association, or purports to act as one` IS TRUE
